discount. Do they frequently have discounts? Is this a good discount or should I wait until later for a better deal?","Attachments":[],"Id":1909420,"PostDate":1452728342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am considering ordering something from Zazzle. Right now, they have a 15% discount. Do they frequently have discounts? Is this a good discount or should I wait until later for a better deal?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;484\/st\/20160413\/e\/Wedding+Day\/k\/c760\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418261031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79859,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9073a4c3d4c1ef1cc79f87324c2c88f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cruisebride2016\"] I remember I looked at them, but I can&#039;t remember what for. Invites I think. If they have a good sale I would say go for it if it&#039;s in your budget. Any wedding vendor that has a good sale is worth following up on. They get you any way they can with pricing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909443,"PostDate":1452739330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281378\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281378-cruisebride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cruisebride2016<\/span><\/a> I remember I looked at them, but I can't remember what for. Invites I think. If they have a good sale I would say go for it if it's in your budget. Any wedding vendor that has a good sale is worth following up on. They get you any way they can with pricing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.136.185.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79859,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fdb443cec99a0ed630ff6ca5b4f742b","RawContent":"It depends on what your ordering. I got my invitations and rsvp&#039;s from there and at the time they only had a 20.6 % off. So i called customer service and i told them because they were closed over the christmas\/new years holiday i missed out on a 60% off, and the guy send me the 60 % discount code and 50% off my shipping. And be advised the shipping price is up there i did express shipping and that was 80 dollars i ended up paying 40. Good luck \n\n\nSent from my LG-H811 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909450,"PostDate":1452762196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It depends on what your ordering. I got my invitations and rsvp's from there and at the time they only had a 20.6 % off. So i called customer service and i told them because they were closed over the christmas\/new years holiday i missed out on a 60% off, and the guy send me the 60 % discount code and 50% off my shipping. And be advised the shipping price is up there i did express shipping and that was 80 dollars i ended up paying 40. Good luck <br><br>\nSent from my LG-H811 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"swong0321@gmail.com","IpAddress":"104.136.185.51","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1451786865,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285746.jpg?_r=1451801267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shanay0321","Id":285746,"Name":"shanay0321","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"168.233.1.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79859,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5108ce0f17ad690bdb4550f873522f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I ordered our STDs from zazzle and although I paid more than I could have (didn&#039;t wait for a good sale). I was really happy with the quality. I even screwed up on the date (I think) and they had already printed and shipped. Because I realized right away and emailed them they credited me back for both the STDs and shipping. Since then I have ordered other items from the site and I have been really happy with them. Customer service goes along way and I&#039;d be happy to recommend zazzle.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909492,"PostDate":1452786239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I ordered our STDs from zazzle and although I paid more than I could have (didn't wait for a good sale). I was really happy with the quality. I even screwed up on the date (I think) and they had already printed and shipped. Because I realized right away and emailed them they credited me back for both the STDs and shipping. Since then I have ordered other items from the site and I have been really happy with them. Customer service goes along way and I'd be happy to recommend zazzle.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423090661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.26.160.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79859,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ed578c3284d5682ef179544ae149372","RawContent":"@acw271011@shanay0321@ashhtayy Thanks for your feedback!! I decided to go for it. I ordered personalized cufflinks that I will give to my groom as his gift on the wedding day. I think he will love them :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1909590,"PostDate":1452908328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @acw271011@shanay0321@ashhtayy Thanks for your feedback!! I decided to go for it. I ordered personalized cufflinks that I will give to my groom as his gift on the wedding day. I think he will love them <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;484\/st\/20160413\/e\/Wedding+Day\/k\/c760\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418261031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAd