{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":22255,"Author":{"Id":286090,"Name":"Natasha28","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1454354369,"Content":"Hey!<br \/>\n<br \/>\nHow's it going? We met at the National Bridal Show two weeks ago.  I'm sorry I forgot your name <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I was the one who chatted you up about destination weddings.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nHope all is well! How many more weeks do you have? I love this forum! Just signed up and still trying to understand it as well.  <br \/>\n<br \/>\nI, too, am I nervous about this Zika virus  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br \/>\n<br \/>\nTalk soon!<br \/>\n<br \/>\nNatasha ","PostKey":"b9930c1e2a493170ba2debf108c35d68","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":22258,"Author":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1454356893,"Content":"<p>Hi Natasha! \u00a0Omg so good to hear from you!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have 89 days until the big day! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This website is soooo helpful! \u00a0You can see my planning thread and some of the other girls, and basically search by topic what you're looking for information on. \u00a0I would suggest you start commenting on people posts and giving feedback, once you hit 150 posts it gives you access to templates people have posted etc, the whole idea is to encourage everyone to participate and really become a \"community\" by supporting each other.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In regards to the Zika virus, it really only affects pregnant women or women who want to conceive. \u00a0We wanted to start trying right away so I made an appt with my doctor to get a blood test when we get back, and if we have to wait, we have to wait. \u00a0I'm not about to cancel my wedding so the best we can do is just be informed and take precautions.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is Deanna btw <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0But everyone on here calls me Dee.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you need any more help with anything!!! xo<\/p>\n","PostKey":"caf5009382b33ea68120fd2eb4707a25","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
